---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About FixLanka Tools — Modern, Privacy-First Online Toolbox"
  description="Learn about the FixLanka Tools mission: useful, high-performance browser-based tools with zero tracking and zero server uploads."
  canonicalUrl="https://fixlanka.com/about"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
        About Our Platform
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        High-Performance Utilities, 100% in Your Browser
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        FixLanka Tools was built to restore simplicity, speed, and privacy to everyday online tasks.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Too many simple tasks—like converting an image format, inspecting a photo's metadata, compressing a PDF, or generating a QR code—now require users to upload sensitive files to unknown cloud servers, sit through intrusive ads, or pay for subscriptions.
        </p>
        <p>
          FixLanka Tools changes that. We leverage modern browser capabilities, including WebAssembly, Web Workers, and the HTML5 Canvas API, to process your files directly inside your device's memory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Core Architectural Principles</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-1">1. Local Processing First</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Files are processed in local RAM and never uploaded to remote servers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-1">2. Zero Registration</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Every tool is instantly usable without creating accounts or supplying personal emails.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-1">3. Honest Metadata & Provenance</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              We inspect EXIF and C2PA Content Credentials transparently, with no deceptive watermark bypasses.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-1">4. Global Access</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Free to use worldwide with ultra-low latency via Cloudflare's global edge network.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Technology Stack</h2>
        <p>
          FixLanka Tools is engineered with modern static-first technologies: Astro for fast page loads and SEO, React for interactive reactive tool state, Tailwind CSS for consistent dark-first design tokens, and battle-tested browser engines like <code>pdf-lib</code>, <code>exifr</code>, and Canvas APIs.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
